    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ProjectionDefinitionRegistar.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.config\"><code>ProjectionDefinitionRegistar</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../../core/config/RepositoryRestConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.config\"><code>RepositoryRestConfiguration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../../core/config/RepositoryRestConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.config\"><code>RepositoryRestConfiguration</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"ProjectionDefinitionRegistar.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.config\"><code>ProjectionDefinitionRegistar</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
