      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanPostProcessor</code></a> to make sure all excerpt projections defined in <a href=\"../../core/mapping/RepositoryResourceMappings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>RepositoryResourceMappings</code></a> are\nregistered with the <a href=\"../../core/config/RepositoryRestConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.config\"><code>RepositoryRestConfiguration</code></a>. This rather external configuration has been used to make\nsure we don't introduce a cyclic dependency between <a href=\"../../core/config/RepositoryRestConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.config\"><code>RepositoryRestConfiguration</code></a> an\n<a href=\"../../core/mapping/RepositoryResourceMappings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>RepositoryResourceMappings</code></a> as the latter need access to the former to discover mappings in the first place.",
      "translation": "使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanPostProcessor</code></a> 来确保在 <a href=\"../../core/mapping/RepositoryResourceMappings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>RepositoryResourceMappings</code></a> 中定义的所有摘录投影都已注册到 <a href=\"../../core/config/RepositoryRestConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.config\"><code>RepositoryRestConfiguration</code></a> 中。这种相对外部的配置方式被采用，是为了避免在 <a href=\"../../core/config/RepositoryRestConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.config\"><code>RepositoryRestConfiguration</code></a> 与 <a href=\"../../core/mapping/RepositoryResourceMappings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>RepositoryResourceMappings</code></a> 之间引入循环依赖，因为后者首先需要访问前者才能发现映射关系。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanPostProcessor.html#postProcessAfterInitialization(java.lang.Object,java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">postProcessAfterInitialization</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanPostProcessor</a></code>",
